{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/802200-devouring-creating-heart","id":802200,"title":"Devouring & creating Heart","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-06T10:18:31-08:00","id":802200,"title":"Devouring & creating Heart","content":"What happens after Devouring, when the &quot;new Beast&quot; wakes up? The Beast is Ravenous, of course. Is the Heart already created, or must the Beast hunt first, get Satiety and than create the Heart paying 1 Satiety? What if the Beast does not create the Heart? And, if the Heart is established &quot;for free&quot; when awaking from Devouring, where is the location of the Heart? The place where the Beast slept? What if the Devouring happened during a flight from Paris to NY?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10749-skydiver","name":"skydiver","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T12:57:00-08:00","id":802285,"title":"","content":"I think that the Heart 'comes with' the Horror so to speak. It is almost a part of the Horror, hence why the Horror (and the beast) die when the heart is destroyed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T13:45:23-08:00","id":802323,"title":"","content":"The Heart is not reflective of any real world location, it exists purely in the Primordial Dream and is a unique location evocative of whichever primal fear the Beast represents","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5328-helmsderp","name":"HelmsDerp","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T14:07:05-08:00","id":802338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>skydiver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/802200-devouring-creating-heart#post802200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And, if the Heart is established &quot;for free&quot; when awaking from Devouring, where is the location of the Heart?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Heart is the core of a Beast's Lair, either formed from the same &quot;place&quot; as the Horror is born from or drawn from a Chamber so deep in the Dream that it's warped and abstracted away from any correspondence besides its Traits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-06T16:59:32-08:00","id":802456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>skydiver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/802200-devouring-creating-heart#post802200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> What if the Devouring happened during a flight from Paris to NY?</div> </div> </div> </div>I love the idea of a Chamber made on a plane, maybe one that's perpetually falling from the sky, with a depressurized cabin. And when you go through the curtains to first class you just end up back in the rear of coach. The horror (especially if Ugallu) could be flying around outside the plane, ripping open the door and shattering windows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T10:23:26-08:00","id":803191,"title":"","content":"Hmm. Maybe this could help: &quot;<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">A Heart acts like any <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">other Chamber except for the fact that it doesn\u2019t correspond <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">to a location the Beast has encountered, so is less useful when <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">opening Primordial Pathways and is more secure against <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">unwanted intrusion.&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10749-skydiver","name":"skydiver","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-07T20:56:24-08:00","id":803554,"title":"","content":"I understood it as reflecting the recurring nightmares that presaged the Devouring, thus, if your Devouring was reminiscent of an aeroplane flight from New York to Paris, wherein the plane was being savaged by a dragon, then the gross details of that plane and the circumstances of its destruction would define the Heart of your Lair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}